Subject: [PATCH 1/2] U19 The doors: Study, Topics, Family, Essays, About

The header doors James chose on 2026-10-26. Books moves under About with
Speaking and Contact; Resources folds into the Topics and Family menus;
/resources stays live at the foot of the Topics menu and in the footer.
The Topics door leads with /topics (U25 builds the page). Search
shortcuts follow the new doors. My Library joins Find Help in the footer
bottom bar. On a phone, tapping a second door's toggle no longer folds
the open one first and misses. The CLAUDE.md Decision Log IA entry and
the llms.txt doors line say what James chose.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
